		"description": "<p>A solid-looking melee weapon, commonly taking the form of a mace, hammer, sword, or similar weapon, with sparks of electricity playing around the head. Upon impact, the weapon discharges a powerful electrical blast which arcs between those nearby; the weapon absorbs any electricity from the attack which would arc back to the wielder.</p><p>The profile for the Arc Weapon can be found in the Military Weapons Table at the start of this section. An Arc Weapon is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Bed rest.</p>",
